OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court on murder charge
OL,4,Aafter teenager's death in Glasgow
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has appeared in court charged
OL,7,Fwith murder after a teenager died
OL,8,Ffollowing a disturbance in the Milton
OL,9,Farea of Glasgow.
OL,11,FJack Mellon, 17, was found fatally
OL,12,Finjured after the incident on Ashgill
OL,13,FRoad at about 18:05 on Wednesday.
OL,15,FEmergency services attended but he was
OL,16,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
