OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court on murder charge
OL,4,Aafter teenager's death in Glasgow
OL,5,
OL,6,FJack Dragsnes, 22, was charged with
OL,7,Fmurder, attempting to pervert the
OL,8,Fcourse of justice and having a knife in
OL,9,Fa public place without a reasonable
OL,10,Fexcuse in Glasgow Sheriff Court. He
OL,11,Fmade no plea and was remanded in
OL,12,Fcustody.
